/doc/helpdir/stats
==================

STATISTICS

A player's statistics (or "stats") are measures of advanced a player is in
certain aspects of his development. There are currently six stats that you
can raise on Darkwind. They are: strength, constitution, dexterity,
                                 intelligence, wisdom, and charisma.
For help on a specific stat, type "help <stat_abbrev>" at the prompt,
where <stat_abbrev> is the three-letter abbreviation for the statistic
you want to see the information of.
eg.  help str    (for strength)
